{"id":"c479712ed846dd17","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Seminorm","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm — ZFC Analysis2 Seminorm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm — ZFC Analysis2 Seminorm","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm — ZFC Analysis2 Seminorm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span> (scalar field)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,p\\in V\">\\(X,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,p\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (fully explicit vector-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}seminorm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S(p,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists +_{\\mathbb F},\\cdot_{\\mathbb F},0_{\\mathbb F},1_{\\mathbb F}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{\\mathbb F},\\cdot_{\\mathbb F},0_{\\mathbb F},1_{\\mathbb F})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land0_X\\in X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_X+_Xx=x=x+_X0_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land p(0_X)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb F\\;\n\\bigl(p(a\\cdot_Xx)=|a|p(x)\\land p(x+_Xy)\\leq p(x)+p(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}seminorm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S(p,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists +_{\\mathbb F},\\cdot_{\\mathbb F},0_{\\mathbb F},1_{\\mathbb F}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{\\mathbb F},\\cdot_{\\mathbb F},0_{\\mathbb F},1_{\\mathbb F})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land0_X\\in X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_X+_Xx=x=x+_X0_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land p(0_X)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb F\\;\n\\bigl(p(a\\cdot_Xx)=|a|p(x)\\land p(x+_Xy)\\leq p(x)+p(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A seminorm has absolute homogeneity and subadditivity but may vanish at nonzero vectors. The scalar-field operations used by the vector-space witness are explicitly bound instead of being selected independently behind a carrier-only abbreviation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (fully explicit vector-space predicate; see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}seminorm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S(p,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\exists +_{\\mathbb F},\\cdot_{\\mathbb F},0_{\\mathbb F},1_{\\mathbb F}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{\\mathbb F},\\cdot_{\\mathbb F},0_{\\mathbb F},1_{\\mathbb F})\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\land0_X\\in X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_X+_Xx=x=x+_X0_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land p(0_X)=0\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb F\\;\n\\bigl(p(a\\cdot_Xx)=|a|p(x)\\land p(x+_Xy)\\leq p(x)+p(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1748,"backlinks":[{"id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S$ (seminorm predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1451","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm.md|58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","592f9cfb6